7L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2116215996">September 7, 2017</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Title:   Lure of the Tiger  <br />Series: Aloha Shifters   Book #4<br />Release Date: #AlreadyReleased<br />Author: Anna Lowe <br />Reviewer: Ingrid Stephanie Jordan <br />Genre: #PRN #TigerShifter #Vampires #DragonsWolfandBearShifters   <br />My Rating: #5Stars☆☆☆☆☆<br />••••••••••••••<br />     Ms. Anna has really done it again, her series is just phenomenal. I know the next one is Silas but then who? I want more.This surfer pro catches the waves and you on the first page, ties you up and takes you for the ride of your life. <br />      Jody Monroe, is a Human Pro Surfer on the Women’s Pro Tour. Finding out she needs to help her family, she decids to model for a fragrance line ‘Elements’ only to come into the sites of a snipper. Being saved by "Dark Eyes" a <br />no-nonsense, crotchety, to die for gorgeous hunk. OMG the biceps****sigh breathlessly****<br />     Cruz Khala is a Tiger Shifter who has never trusted a human. He is very quiet because why talk if he has nothing to say. He is living in a Tree House on Koa Point in Hawaii, an working with the shifters from his old Special Forces Team. They started a private investigator agency. On his own private mission, he knew his life was about to change. Wanting to kill and protect at once was quite a fast change for Cruz, will he save this women or kill her? <br />     A copy of this book was provided to me with no requirements for a review. I voluntarily read this book and my comments here are my honest opinion.</span></div><div class="