9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2117395045">September 8, 2017</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Go with your heart 5 BLUE JEWELS<br /><br />instinct drew her toward him, like…like he was her destiny. Now repeat after me, Mr. Cruz Khala. “Life is beautiful. Love is beautiful. You just have to believe.” Life is for living, his tiger agreed. Loving. Laughing. THIS IS SO PUUUUURRRRFECT! What an ABSO-ROARING-LUTELY TIGERIFIC TAIL &amp; A HALF!! I really wasn't sure what to expect for Cruz's story but it sure wasn't THIS!! But I mean that in all of the best ways possible! Even though he has been in all of the other books, Cruz has been in the background, silent, pacing, glaring, surly &amp; silently pacing while glaring &amp; acting all surly, meaning that until little Keiki showed up, I wasn't even sure Cruz was capable of anything else but all that! However, I wasn't even a quarter of the way in and my gut hurt from laughing so hard at the antics of Tiger-Cruz and my jaw was killing me from dropping it so many times with Human-Cruz's actions, thoughts &amp; reactions! Who knew Tigers could coo?? It's DE-BAIT-ABLE as to what - or who - lured me in the quickest - the chance to FINALLY get up close and personal with Cruz or the chance to become the one to break down all of the walls around his heart and accept him as my mate. I don't know who was worked up the most - Cruz, Jody or me! Well, actually, it was me all the way since I lived this all through, with, for and as both Cruz and Jody! My ABSO-SHIFTING-LUTELY favorite feature to Shifter books is when the animal side is given his own personality, in this case a TIGERALITY, that communicates with the Human half because I find it lets me connect to both sides of the character, enriching &amp; enhancing the story even more so than usual! This story has it in spades...errr, in stripes!! Anna has done this so perfectly with Cruz and his Tiger that I was cracking up right from the very start, falling in love with Tiger-Cruz before I did with Human-Cruz! The wait between Lure of the Bear (book 3) and this one was torture, because I love, Love, LOVE this series, but HOLEY MOLEY! Was the wait ever worth it! Maybe it's all because of Cruz and the chance to get to know him, understand what it means to be him, the chance to love him through Jody's eyes, Anna's eyes and my own eyes. Maybe it’s because of the chance to get to know Jody, to be her, the Human that breaks down all of Cruz’s barriers, has Cruz learning that life doesn’t have to be so serious all the time. Or maybe - and most likely - it is ALLLLLLL ANNA! I have to say that as much as I love this series and every other couple I have had the immense pleasure of meeting, getting to know and have lived their HEA journey with and as them, Lure of the Tiger, Cruz &amp; Jody are my ABSOLUTE FAVORITES, PAWS DOWN!! And yes, even though I haven't read them all - YET - this is by far and wide, the most intriguing, humorous, captivating, passionate, spellbinding, jaw-dropping, intense, heart-pounding, PHENOMENAL Shifter book and is Anna's BEST. BOOK. EVER. With Anna's unrivaled talent, this story literally exploded to life, sucking me in so deep I couldn't stop reading even if I wanted to!! (Which I didn't!) I am wholly, ut