66C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2115786272">September 6, 2017</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">This is an exciting suspense filled paranormal shifter story.Cruz Khala is a ex military elite soldier an now body guard besides other things. Cruz hates humans because he believes humans killed his father,mother and brother an sister. When he gets a job to execute the person responsible for killing his family. As he lays on the hill watching through the scope of his silenced rifle he has a feeling something isn't right. He's never felt this way before and his tiger is pacing .When the most beautiful woman he's ever seen walks out on the balcony his tiger notices an keeps saying mine.When a slimy looking man comes up to the beauty an grabs her arm his tiger growls.,the beauty pulls away but listens them the man walks away. He wishes the man is the target. But when the beauty is given the drink that says she's the target, his tiger says it isn't right and no matter how Cruz lines up the shot he can't pull the trigger. He breaks down his weapon an and scans the area when he sees another shooter. He quietly go to save the beauty. When he hears the slimy guy tell her to go back out on the balcony Cruz grabs her arm and tells her to come with him. She pulls her arm back an says I don't know you an I'm not going anywhere with you. Then Cruz pushed her down in time before the bullet crashes where she was.He tells her to stay low an grabs her an pulls her outside as bullets continue to fly.Will Cruz be able to keep this beauty safe? When he asks her name she says Jody Monroe, Jody is a pro surfer currently number eleven in the world .Will Cruz finally realize that Jody is his mate? Will the team of shifters keep her safe ? Will the Sapphire that she's supposed to pose with be one of the sacred stones powerful and if in the hands of the wrong person deadly? I love the way Jody works to help Cruz see the beauty in the world. And the sexual chemistry between Cruz and Jody is off the chart. Watch Cruz go from grumpy dark hooded to bright and with hope finally seeing beauty in the world thanks to jody. This story has plenty of suspense,action,hot sex and handsome shifters with bodies that would make a sculptor proud. And beautiful women that heal the hearts and souls of these brave men.I voluntarily decided to review this advanced reader copy because it's a great paranormal shifter romance story. I can hardly wait to see what's next by this multi talented aurhor..</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.