166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></defs><use clip-path="url(#clip_RatingStar_undefined0small)" href="#path_RatingStar_undefined0small" class="RatingStar__backgroundFill"></use><path class="RatingStar__fill"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5896081819">October 9, 2023</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted"><strong>Swoons, danger and healing </strong><br /><br />I loved Cruz and Jody’s fated mates, human-shifter, opposites attract romance. It was wonderful mix of sweet, steamy, real life issues, and danger. I have a soft spot for the people who are living a narrow life because of their scars, like Cruz. So I love when they finally embrace living life and get swoon worthy HEAs. I also loved the way Jody, just by being herself, gently, lovingly, and beautifully helped Cruz come out of his self-imposed prison and begin to believe in light and goodness. Jody is a human pro surfer who has signed an endorsement contract for perfume but only because her family needs the money. She is joyful about life and faces things head on. Cruz is a tiger shifter who recently retired from special forces. He lives in Hawaii with his four shifter brothers in arms. Cruz hates humans, with a few exceptions, because he believes they murdered his entire family. He is solitary and growly. Cruz and Jody meet when he is given information that the person responsible for killing his family will be at a specific party, wearing black clothing, and be served a specific drink. Jody fits the description but Cruz understands immediately that she is innocent so instead of killing her, he saves her from another shooter and begins to protect her. To get to their HEA, they will need to keep Jody safe while determining who wants her dead and fulfill her modeling contract all while Cruz tries to find acceptance of his past so he can move on. The story was well written and included witty dialogue, three dimensional characters, and an engaging storyline as shown through sweet moments, steamy scenes, fighting, dangerous situations, shifter physiology and cultures, evil actors, henchmen, loyal friends and family, tragic back stories, mystery, revelations, plot twists, big feels, healing, and laughs. I can’t wait to read the next book in this series. </span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16.7361314 18.6701344,17.3185188 18.1373501,17.6453922 L17.9472136,17.7480616 C17.4795438,17