llow Bend, this is my favorite. Cruz Khala is a former special forces soldier living at Koa Point on Maui with his brothers in arms, an assortment of shifters. His family was murdered while visiting India and the local villagers blamed the attack on humans. Cruz has been hunting those responsible and has been provided information about the person behind the assault. He makes a plan, but when the time comes to kill the assassin, he can't pull the trigger. Something isn't right and he senses his human target is innocent. But he also senses a second sniper with the unknown woman in his sights. And Cruz quickly shifts from termination to protection mode. <br />Jody Monroe is a professional surfer on the island for a photo shoot for a fragrance line. She hates feeling that she's sold out, but needs the money for her family. Part of her contract is 'meet and greet's' at scheduled social events. Which is where she is when a large, intense man hustles her away as bullets start flying. Now he's asking her to trust him, a stranger. But she is in need of a bodyguard now, and that is just what he says he is. Oh, and that he was also trying to kill her.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034