6C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2948036043">August 22, 2019</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Audio book review <br />Love this whole series. And love this one since I love tigers . Anna knows how to intertwine a little bit of the past characters in her other books within this story . Anna also knows how to keep the man true to his shifter animal. <br />Hero is Cruz. Heroine is Jody<br /><br />Cruz hates humans and there is a big reason why... he blames humans for his parents murder. Cruz is also a tiger shifter and he is true to his animal..... he’s moody, stubborn... and once he gets an idea in his mind nothing can throw him off .<br />Jody is a surfer but she decides to do a gig as a model for the extra money her family needs . <br />Cruz sees Jody and his tiger knows right away that Jody is their mate but Cruz the man won’t accept it . <br />Both Cruz and Jody will have to lean to trust each other and get along because Jody has to do a screamer with a spirt stone which can be very dangerous. . <br />Will they know what the spirt stone is all about . Will Cruz figure out that Jody is not like other humans <br /><br />The performance of Kelsey was good . She did all the tones of the characters and scenes good. Her voice is storing and clear </span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.1036344 C19,16.7361314 18.6701344,17.3185188 18.1373501,17.6453922 L17.9472136,17.7480616 C17.4795438,17.9818965 16.9638538,18.1036344 16.440983,18.1036344 L9.66834148,18.1034086 C9.31027068,18.6437214 8.696742,19 8,19 L6,19 C4.8954305,19 4,18.1045695 4,17 L4,12 C4,10.8954305 4.8954305,10 6,10 L8,10 C8.60249245,10 9.14276174,10.2664091 9.50943372,10.6878531 L9.58578644,10.6036344 L11,9.18942086 L11,6.75238209 C10.9999468,5.91477784 11.5910613,5.19356674 12.4123594,5.02913493 C13.3640475,4.8385978 14.290004,5.45563256 14.4813282,6.41129383 Z M8,11 L6,11 C5.44771525,11 5,11.4477153 5,12 L5,17 C5,17.5522847 5.44771525,18 6,18 L8,18 C8.55228475,18 9,17.5522847 9,17 L9,12 C9,11.4477153 8.55228475,11 8,11 Z M12.6086732,6.00967606 C12.2547259,6.08053973 11.9999771,6.39134718 12,6.75231863 L12,9.60363442 L10.2928932,11.3107412 L10.2060806,11.4098185 C10.0731645,11.583364 10,11.7968342 10,12.017848 L10,17.1036344 L16.440983,17.1036344 L16.6607228,17.0934175 C16.9522889,17.0662447 17.2369485,16.9851602 17.5,16.8536344 L17.5527864,16.8272412 L17.6