><span class="Formatted">Cruz's turn to find a mate but that's not what he wants. He wants to find the person behind the killing of his family and when he's told who it is he plans on killing that person. When he has her in his sights he finds he can't do it. Jody is a surfer on a modeling job but only because it'll help her father and sister otherwise she's prefer to be in the water. When shots start flying at her she saved by Cruz and finds that the stories her mom told her about love at first sight might be true. After Cruz finds out that the person who told him about Jody was set up and another is shooting at her, he finds himself taking her home and his tiger wants to keep her. <br /><br />Another hit by this author! I love the characters and this story is one of the best in this series! You can't go wrong reading these books. It has a bunch of everything shifters, suspense, crazy aunts with stories you thought were fiction and lots of heat!! Can't wait for the next book and hmmm maybe more on mermaids in the future? I received a copy under no obligation.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19