 of a snipper. Being saved by \"Dark Eyes\" a \u003cbr /\u003eno-nonsense, crotchety, to die for gorgeous hunk. OMG the biceps****sigh breathlessly****\u003cbr /\u003e     Cruz Khala is a Tiger Shifter who has never trusted a human. He is very quiet because why talk if he has nothing to say. He is living in a Tree House on Koa Point in Hawaii, an working with the shifters from his old Special Forces Team. They started a private investigator agency. On his own private mission, he knew his life was about to change. Wanting to kill and protect at once was quite a fast change for Cruz, will he save this women or kill her? \u003cbr /\u003e     A copy of this book was provided to me with no requirements for a review. I voluntarily read this book and my comments here are my honest opinion.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3IUMSZH2GKQ6D\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:41882678":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":41882678,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1633159711i/41882678._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":14,"textReviewsCount":903,"name":"Diana Page","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/41882678-diana-page","contributor":null,"id":41882678},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A16TVPJTEHFJ3H":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A16TVPJTEHFJ3H"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A16TVPJTEHFJ3H\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A16TVPJTEHFJ3H","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A16TVPJTEHFJ3H"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"