I must say I absolutely enjoy reading paranormal shifter romance especially ones that involves, Tigers, Dragons, Wolves, Vampires and my most favorite Bear Shifters, so this book by Anna Lowe I really love reading. I know I'm telling my age but this series remind me of Magnum P.I. with Tom Selleck, oh my, if this became a TV series I would plant myself in front of the television and not move until it was over and I would record it so I could watch it again. I'm always excited to read this series. This is the fourth book written in this series. It features Cruz Khala andJody Monroe with the rest of the gang from the three previous books of the ALOHA SHIFTERS. Cruz is a Tiger shifter who is graceful, ruthless, gorgeous, sexy with yellow-green eyes. He is also gruff and grouchy, painfully private, yet tender and protective but there is a problem he doesn’t put much trust in humans. Jody is a pro surfer, a very reluctant model who is strikingly beautiful, footloose, carefree and a woman on a mission. But unknown to her there are two assassin and one is Cruz. The story has magic, lots of adventure and humor. I love and enjoy the books that are written by Anna Lowe. She is very talented and gifted author, she creates enjoyable,lovable,sexy characters and magical, exciting worlds. Anne stories are always humorous and magical which will entice and weave a AWESOME tale that pulls you into the adventures with her relatable characters. I know we all just fall in love with a hero that's irresistible with his tormented soulful eyes that just melts our heart. Oh yeah the heroine we all appreciated a strong woman who is capable of fighting and loving along side her man but when there's danger around, she knows she can let her man protect her and still be admired and loved the love her life, because he knows she won't just rush into the fray and endanger them both by just hoping for the best. That's just the some of what I enjoy and love while reading Anna books. I really enjoy her love scenes she has a talent for writing blazing hot sensual sex scenes, she ramps up the tension between Jody and a Cruz before during and after they make love. I enjoy when you can laugh and smile while reading the sexual scenes even through its can be very explicit. Because this allows me a clear sense of the love between the hero and heroine and to enjoy it without feeling I'm reading porn. Anna Lowe stories JEWELS of the HEART is a thrilling series set on the tropical shores of Maui. I have love reading each story they are exciting page-turner that's packed with action, emotion, and romance! Paranormal Shifters twist of course its has steamy hot, alpha shifters! The story has a depth of emotion which tugs at my heart. This book captured my attention quickly from beginning to end. Each story has its own jewel that comes with its own danger. The couples are made up a Shifter from the ALOHA SHIFTERS and their mate has the power to control the jewel and each jewel is calling to the other jewels. Cruz and Jody the story Lure of the Tiger. This leads the series into the story we are all excited to read Silas story. The entire series is one that just gets more exciting as we read each story they have kept me on the edge of my seat. If you enjoy reading Paranormal Shifter Romance then you will love this series. ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1NZZ3AK63D7ZY\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:16090680":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":16090680,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1531082024i/16090680._UY200_CR5,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":922,"name":"Cherri-Anne","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/16090680-cherri-anne","contributor":null,"id":16090680},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3K00LDO6NS1JX":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3K00LDO6NS1JX"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3K00LDO6NS1JX\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3K00LDO6NS1JX","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3K00LDO6NS1JX"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/16090680?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2117395045"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.c1G1GzeVHvpcwIYVoYgVkA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.c1G1GzeVHvpcwIYVoYgVkA","creator":{"__ref":"User:16090680"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1504830057620,"createdAt":1504830012231,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1504830057359,"text":"Go with your heart 5 BLUE JEWELS\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003einstinct drew her toward him, like…like he was her destiny. Now repeat after me, Mr. Cruz Khala. “Life is beautiful. Love is beautiful. You just have to believe.” Life is for living, his tiger agreed. Loving. Laughing. THIS IS SO PUUUUURRRRFECT! What an ABSO-ROARING-LUTELY TIGERIFIC TAIL \u0026amp; A HALF!! I really wasn't sure what to expect for Cruz's story but it sure wasn't THIS!! But I mean that in all of the best ways possible! Even though he has been in all of the other books, Cruz has been in the background, silent, pacing, glaring, surly \u0026amp; silently pacing while glaring \u0026amp; acting all surly, meaning that until little Keiki showed up, I wasn't even sure Cruz was capable of anything else but all that! However, I wasn't even a quarter of the way in and my gut hurt from laughing so hard at the antics of Tiger-Cruz and my jaw was killing me from dropping it so many times with Human-Cruz's actions, thoughts \u0026amp; reactions! Who knew Tigers could coo?? It's DE-BAIT-ABLE as to what - or who - lured me in the quickest - the chance to FINALLY get up close and personal with Cruz or the chance to become the one to break down all of the walls around his heart and accept him as my mate. I don't know who was worked up the most - Cruz, Jody or me! Well, actually, it was me all the way since I lived this all through, with, for and as both Cruz and Jody! My ABSO-SHIFTING-LUTELY favorite feature to Shifter books is when the animal side is given his own personality, in this case a TIGERALITY, that communicates with the Human half because I find it lets me connect to both sides of the character, enriching \u0026amp; enhancing the story even more so than usual! This story has it in spades...errr, in stripes!! Anna has done this so perfectly with Cruz and his Tiger that I was cracking up right from the very start, falling in love with Tiger-Cruz before I did with Human-Cruz! The wait between Lure of the Bear (book 3) and this one was torture, because I love, Love, LOVE this series, but HOLEY MOLEY! Was the wait ever worth it! Maybe it's all because of Cruz and the chance to get to know him, understand what it means to be him, the chance to love him through Jody's eyes, Anna's eyes and my own eyes. Maybe it’s because of the chance to get to know Jody, to be her, the Human that breaks down all of Cruz’s barriers, has Cruz learning that life doesn’t have to be so serious all the time. Or maybe - and most likely - it is ALLLLLLL ANNA! I have to say that as much as I love this series and every other couple I have had the immense pleasure of meeting, getting to know and have lived their HEA journey with and as them, Lure of the Tiger, Cruz \u0026amp; Jody are my ABSOLUTE FAVORITES, PAWS DOWN!! And yes, even though I haven't read them all - YET - this is by far and wide, the most intriguing, humorous, captivating, passionate, spellbinding, jaw-dropping, intense, heart-pounding, PHENOMENAL Shifter book and is Anna's BEST. BOOK. EVER. With Anna's unrivaled talent, this story literally exploded to life, sucking me in so deep I couldn't stop reading even if I wanted to!! (Which I didn't!) I am wholly, utterly and completely consumed - mind, body, heart and soul, all thanks to fate, destiny and the Lure of a Tiger!!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3K00LDO6NS1JX\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:10790042":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":10790042,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1445519063i/10790042._UY200_CR45,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":16,"textReviewsCount":1711,"name":"Racy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/10790042-racy","contributor":null,"id":10790042},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2B7USD3D97CH4":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2B7USD3D97CH4"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2B7USD3D97CH4\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2B7USD3D97CH4","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2B7USD3D97CH4"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10790042?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2138741941"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.wWANEwxO87KQ5Ung8xiAxw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.wWANEwxO87KQ5Ung8xiAxw","creator":{"__ref":"User:10790042"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1507220192593,"createdAt":1507220173002,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1507220192106,"text":"I don’t know anyone that has read at least one book in these series that has not been hooked. You can not help but fall in love with Silas, Kai, Boone, Hunter, and Cruz. Not to mention the wonderful women they bring into the story. This story is about Cruz. I don’t know about you but I have so been looking forward to reading about Cruz and the woman the author would chose for this grumpy angry tiger.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI did do the whipsersync with this book. Truly love the narrator. The narrator did a wonderful job and done a great job pulling you into the story. I did find though that the audios with this series does not always match up with the book. From time to time there where sentences that were reworded, words left out, or even a sentence is complete added. Does not take a way from the story though.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCruz Khala was this sexy tiger shifter but he was grumpy, angry, and seemed to hate every thing, especially human’s. As we get to know Cruz we do get to understand him and can not blame him. The anger he carries around is slowly killing his spirit. He believes human’s were responsible for his parents death. To carry this around for years and long for the day you can venge your families death has to be a heavy weight to bare.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJody Monroe was this amazing woman. She was a pro surfer and I just loved her free spirit. I also loved the love she had for her family. She would do anything for them even if it meant doing a modeling gig to make some money to help them out. I am sure she never dreamed she would be on someone’s hit list. She was the type of person you feel in love with, not want to kill.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe one thing I love about this story is that we get to see the battle between animal and man. Though Cruz and his tiger are one, they are two different spirits that share on body. We get to see Cruz inwardly argue with his tiger. The animal was the smart one in this story. He knew the moment he saw Jody she was not a killer. Cruz on the other hand was facing this inward battle.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI know this had to be a hard decision for Jody to make on trusting Cruz. I love how she went with her heart and her gut. I also loved how she really got under Cruz skin. He was finding it so hard to resist her.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere is danger all around. The jewel that Jody was suppose to do a photo shoot with could be a one of the Spirit Stone. This meant the danger Jody was in could be more serious then they had thought.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOne of my many favorite scenes in the story was one of the photo shoots. Lets just say things get pretty hot and steamy. I sorry want to know more about that scene you will have to read the book. Trust me when I say this book has some many wonderful parts.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBy the end of the book, though I love how it ended I was screaming at Anne Lowe. Please tell me that is not who she is going to put with Silas. No no, no!!!!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis truly was a great story and glad I got a chance to read the book.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2B7USD3D97CH4\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:27349116":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":27349116,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1470542855i/27349116._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":89,"textReviewsCount":4290,"name":"Marsha Keeper Bookshelf","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/27349116-marsha-keeper-bookshelf","contributor":null,"id":27349116},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1AZ2SJOJR2I25":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1AZ2SJOJR2I25"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1AZ2SJOJR2I25\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1AZ2SJOJR2I25","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1AZ2SJOJR2I25"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27349116?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27349116?shelf=paranormal-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"series","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27349116?shelf=series"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"shifter-haven","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27349116?shelf=shifter-haven"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"shifter-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27349116?shelf=shifter-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"strong-sexual-content","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27349116?shelf=strong-sexual-content"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2119604025"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.yFiO24gHUYk3Ek8KpPVF5g":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.yFiO24gHUYk3Ek8KpPVF5g","creator":{"__ref":"User:27349116"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1505042657913,"createdAt":1505042609338,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1505042657589,"text":" \u003ca href=\"http://www.shifterhaven.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eReviewed at Shifter Haven\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI will admit to having a special kind of love for cat shifters, so I’ve been looking forward to the brooding, elusive tiger shifter’s story… a lot. And I wasn’t one tiny bit disappointed for Cruz was paired with his absolutely perfect mate… see destiny or fate does know what it’s doing.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJody and Cruz met under most unusual circumstances, but saving a life, even if that wasn’t his first plan was the right thing to do. Jody was nothing like he expected the betrayer of his family to be, probably because she was as innocent as a lamb… and a possible decoy for what someone really wanted. Cruz’s tiger knew precisely what this woman was… theirs, and he wasn’t shutting up about that fact either, much to Cruz’s annoyance. Having conversations, out loud, with his other half made him appear quite crazy at times, but this amazing lady took everything Cruz could dish out in her easy going stride.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI really liked Jody. I like all of this crew’s mates, but Jody has that unexplained ‘something’ that puts her at the top of the heroine list. Maybe it’s her family’s history of accepting the unacceptable easily, maybe it’s her outlook on life, or maybe she’s just a super smart, likable person. But Jody captured my attention just as much as Cruz did.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere is danger in Lure of the Tiger …danger to more than just Cruz and Jody. In many ways this romance sets up the story we’ve all been waiting to hear, Silas. The connections become apparent as we discover who is behind the attacks on Jody and Cruz. While I truly don’t want this series to end too soon, I have to admit to needing to know Silas’ story.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI was once again captured by the feel of being back on the location of Magnum, P I, I even have my own Tom Selleck candidate among these shifters. *grin* While not every couple has a large part in this story, we do get to meet up with the rest of the crew. If you love Shifter Romance, have fond memories of a certain Hawaiian private investigator and simply love a really, really good story – then Lure of the Tiger and this entire series is one you should already be deeply involved with. I would highly recommend the Aloha Shifters – Jewels of the Heart series to any Paranormal Romance or Shifter Romance reader who enjoys fast paced action, sexy moments and truly likable main characters.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI read this title through my Kindle Unlimited subscription.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1AZ2SJOJR2I25\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:36889019":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":36889019,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":3,"textReviewsCount":556,"name":"Char Davis","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/36889019-char-davis","contributor":null,"id":36889019},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1HQHOR2UF5Q2L":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HQHOR2UF5Q2L"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HQHOR2UF5Q2L\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1HQHOR2UF5Q2L","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HQHOR2UF5Q2L"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/36889019?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2115786272"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.zYMvi2UIKvAJydmXdNaSag":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.zYMvi2UIKvAJydmXdNaSag","creator":{"__ref":"User:36889019"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1504714137933,"createdAt":1504712637277,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1504714137265,"text":"This is an exciting suspense filled paranormal shifter story.Cruz Khala is a ex military elite soldier an now body guard besides other things. Cruz hates humans because he believes humans killed his father,mother and brother an sister. When he gets a job to execute the person responsible for killing his family. As he lays on the hill watching through the scope of his silenced rifle he has a feeling something isn't right. He's never felt this way before and his tiger is pacing .When the most beautiful woman he's ever seen walks out on the balcony his tiger notices an keeps saying mine.When a slimy looking man comes up to the beauty an grabs her arm his tiger growls.,the beauty pulls away but listens them the man walks away. He wishes the man is the target. But when the beauty is given the drink that says she's the target, his tiger says it isn't right and no matter how Cruz lines up the shot he can't pull the trigger. He breaks down his weapon an and scans the area when he sees another shooter. He quietly go to save the beauty. When he hears the slimy guy tell her to go back out on the balcony Cruz grabs her arm and tells her to come with him. She pulls her arm back an says I don't know you an I'm not going anywhere with you. Then Cruz pushed her down in time before the bullet crashes where she was.He tells her to stay low an grabs her an pulls her outside as bullets continue to fly.Will Cruz be able to keep this beauty safe? When he asks her name she says Jody Monroe, Jody is a pro surfer currently number eleven in the world .Will Cruz finally realize that Jody is his mate? Will the team of shifters keep her safe ? Will the Sapphire that she's supposed to pose with be one of the sacred stones powerful and if in the hands of the wrong person deadly? I love the way Jody works to help Cruz see the beauty in the world. And the sexual chemistry between Cruz and Jody is off the chart. Watch Cruz go from grumpy dark hooded to bright and with hope finally seeing beauty in the world thanks to jody. This story has plenty of suspense,action,hot sex and handsome shifters with bodies that would make a sculptor proud. And beautiful women that heal the hearts and souls of these brave men.I voluntarily decided to review this advanced reader copy because it's a great paranormal shifter romance story. I can hardly wait to see what's next by this multi talented aurhor..","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1HQHOR2UF5Q2L\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:18044929":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":18044929,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1362421663i/18044929.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":156,"textReviewsCount":1954,"name":"Elizabeth Neal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/18044929-elizabeth-neal","contributor":null,"id":18044929},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A611Q35WFHP7R":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A611Q35WFHP7R"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A611Q35WFHP7R\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A611Q35WFHP7R","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A611Q35WFHP7R"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/18044929?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2116173883"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.klLLpUTAoKOlS_szNAiQKg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.klLLpUTAoKOlS_szNAiQKg","creator":{"__ref":"User:18044929"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1504737172510,"createdAt":1504737064075,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1504737172232,"text":"Cruz, a tiger shifter, has her in his sights, no, literally, he's looking for his target. He just didn't think it would be the beautiful woman who looked like she'd rather be anywhere else. For the first time, he begins to question the intel he received from his usual contact. Then he sees a reflection, and realizes he isn't the only one lying in wait.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJody, a professional surfer, is regretting her decision to accept the modeling contract, but she knows her family needs the money in more ways than one. As she's in Hawaii, attending a party as required by her stupid contract, she meets the sexiest man she's ever seen. As if that wasn't enough, he then, surprisingly, saves her life. Only to tell her afterward that he was sent to kill her. *gasp*\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCruz has no idea why a hit was ordered on Jody, nor can he get in touch with his contact to ask questions. As he and Jody spend time together, Cruz appointing himself her bodyguard, they begin to investigate who is after Jody and why. And, to bring about even more questions and concerns, it seems as if Jody is somehow linked to one of the Spirit Stones Cruz and his friends and co-workers have been searching for.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThroughout all this, Cruz and Jody begin falling for one another, despite the fact that Cruz has held a personal distrust of all humans since losing his family because of one. But things aren't always as they seem, and Jody's present situation, and the danger surrounding her, may just be connected to Cruz's painful past.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWill Cruz push Jody away because of his prejudice regarding humans? Will Jody understand why he feels that way, but fight for them at the same time? Why is Jody being hunted? Can Cruz keep her safe? Will they remove the threat before it's too late? Will Cruz and Jody get their HEA? How is Silas's ex, the woman he once thought he'd loved that in turn betrayed him, connected?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOne-click now and follow along as Cruz, purposefully isolated from all emotion, finds the woman that brings sunshine back into his life, causing him to bask in it. Please keep in mind that while each book in the series features a different couple, there is an overall storyline running throughout all of them.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e**I voluntarily read and reviewed an Advanced Reader Copy of this book.**","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A611Q35WFHP7R\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:27978578":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":27978578,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1598392270i/27978578._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":29,"textReviewsCount":2128,"name":"Tammy Moldovan","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/27978578-tammy-moldovan","contributor":null,"id":27978578},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3ARCB4ZTDESB1":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ARCB4ZTDESB1"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ARCB4ZTDESB1\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3ARCB4ZTDESB1","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ARCB4ZTDESB1"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27978578?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5896081819"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.IoJ_YL8V_2L9nvzcHwAuWA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.IoJ_YL8V_2L9nvzcHwAuWA","creator":{"__ref":"User:27978578"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1696891834558,"createdAt":1696885068264,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1696891834558,"text":"\u003cstrong\u003eSwoons, danger and healing \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved Cruz and Jody’s fated mates, human-shifter, opposites attract romance. It was wonderful mix of sweet, steamy, real life issues, and danger. I have a soft spot for the people who are living a narrow life because of their scars, like Cruz. So I love when they finally embrace living life and get swoon worthy HEAs. I also loved the way Jody, just by being herself, gently, lovingly, and beautifully helped Cruz come out of his self-imposed prison and begin to believe in light and goodness. Jody is a human pro surfer who has signed an endorsement contract for perfume but only because her family needs the money. She is joyful about life and faces things head on. Cruz is a tiger shifter who recently retired from special forces. He lives in Hawaii with his four shifter brothers in arms. Cruz hates humans, with a few exceptions, because he believes they murdered his entire family. He is solitary and growly. Cruz and Jody meet when he is given information that the person responsible for killing his family will be at a specific party, wearing black clothing, and be served a specific drink. Jody fits the description but Cruz understands immediately that she is innocent so instead of killing her, he saves her from another shooter and begins to protect her. To get to their HEA, they will need to keep Jody safe while determining who wants her dead and fulfill her modeling contract all while Cruz tries to find acceptance of his past so he can move on. The story was well written and included witty dialogue, three dimensional characters, and an engaging storyline as shown through sweet moments, steamy scenes, fighting, dangerous situations, shifter physiology and cultures, evil actors, henchmen, loyal friends and family, tragic back stories, mystery, revelations, plot twists, big feels, healing, and laughs. I can’t wait to read the next book in this series. ","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3ARCB4ZTDESB1\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:27077906":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":27077906,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1388263415i/27077906.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":5,"textReviewsCount":1409,"name":"Cindy Caron","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/27077906-cindy-caron","contributor":null,"id":27077906},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2GC3Y9VLWLL2D":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2GC3Y9VLWLL2D"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2GC3Y9VLWLL2D\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2GC3Y9VLWLL2D","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2GC3Y9VLWLL2D"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/27077906?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2115608056"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.W-F-oLzDEtp_fAGMNgKR2g":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.W-F-oLzDEtp_fAGMNgKR2g","creator":{"__ref":"User:27077906"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1504698589699,"createdAt":1504698574388,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1504698589401,"text":"In this, the fourth episode of the Koa Point Shifters series, Cruz is forced to face his own personal demons when he’s led astray, given a bogus lead that would have him playing target practice with the one woman who could possibly change his life. But when things suddenly don’t seem to add up, he follows his instincts and his heart. Jody has taken this modelling job without reading all of the fine print, and boy oh boy, can she see her error with that. Only its too late to do anything about it now, except follow through on her part and hope for the best. But when someone suddenly seems to be taking shots at her, with bullets no less, she’s not too sure about anything, especially why anyone would want her dead. When the most devastatingly handsome man she’s ever seen in her life comes to her rescue, asking her to trust him, and bullets are still flying, what’s a girl supposed to do? Follow her heart of course! The action these two find, all without looking, is mind boggling, and more than what either was looking for. Will it all work out in the end or will these two meet their maker first?\u003cbr /\u003eMs. Lowe has once again given us a fast paced tale that will have you on the edge of your seat from the first page until the end. Her never ending talent to spin a complete and enchanting tale from a niggle of an idea continues with this series. If you have read any of her other series in the past, you will find a few are referenced in this one also, tying them all together in a way, yet separate. Her wonderful writing skills are always showcased and never disappoint, as I’m sure you will discover when reading this book. Now all I have to do is sit back and wait for the tale of Silas! Will he ever find his true fated mate? Or will he be destined to live out his long life solo?\u003cbr /\u003eI received a copy of this book and am voluntarily giving my honest review.\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2GC3Y9VLWLL2D\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:41759133":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":41759133,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1614784539i/41759133.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":45,"textReviewsCount":3228,"name":"Elgyn","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/41759133-elgyn","contributor":null,"id":41759133},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A35P0V21LH1JA6":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A35P0V21LH1JA6"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.qelGLNTw_1Y3wUfD":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.qelGLNTw_1Y3wUfD"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A35P0V21LH1JA6\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.qelGLNTw_1Y3wUfD\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A35P0V21LH1JA6","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A35P0V21LH1JA6"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.qe