shelf=sassy-females"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"series","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/13055353?shelf=series"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"shifters","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/13055353?shelf=shifters"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"suspense","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/13055353?shelf=suspense"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2171435182"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.mewoSNGzJkwWhYomNBQsIw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.mewoSNGzJkwWhYomNBQsIw","creator":{"__ref":"User:13055353"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1509595089480,"createdAt":1509594940805,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1509595088884,"text":"I wasn’t sure about Cruz’ story as he always seemed to be the quiet, mean and scary one. Hunter always came across as loveable but Cruz was always someone you’d want to steer clear of. Turns out, Cruz is my new favourite over Hunter! Having read his story, it’s clear why he is the king of the monosyllabic conversation and having met his mate... he still retains that crown.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCruz meets his mate Jody on a job... or to be more precise, when he’s been hired to kill her! Fortunately Fate prevents him from carrying out the contract and instead of killing her, he ends up rescuing Jody from an unexpected situation and takes her home to Koa Point to keep her safe. Then in an abrupt turn of events, instead of being her hired killer, he becomes her bodyguard and that’s when things get really interesting between them. As all the others in the series have done, he fights against the idea that Jody is his mate but in the case of Cruz, he fights even harder against his attraction because of his hatred for humans who killed his family but there are a lot of lessons to be learned along the way... especially when a character from the previous books makes an unexpected appearance.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAll of the previous characters in the series have fleeting appearances in this book which is a good way to catch up with what is going on in their lives but if I’m totally honest, Keiki is my absolute favourite! I love how the big, tough, macho men turn to mush whenever she’s around and the women are happy to share their mates with her.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eUnusually for me, I still don’t know who is behind all the attempts made on the mates throughout the series so am hoping that all is revealed in Silas’ story but I’m looking forward to finally finding it all out.\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EII3HFIV6BD0\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:25229672":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":25229672,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1434393709i/25229672._UX200_CR0,63,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":17,"textReviewsCount":1517,"name":"Carole","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/25229672-carole","contributor":null,"id":25229672},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AQBRF997Y1O04":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AQBRF997Y1O04"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AQBRF997Y1O04\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AQBRF997Y1O04","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AQBRF997Y1O04"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"intrigue-suspense-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=intrigue-suspense-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mystical-paranormal-magical","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=mystical-paranormal-magical"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal-animal-shifter","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=paranormal-animal-shifter"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal-vampire-shifter","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25229672?shelf=paranormal-vampire-shifter"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2326230813"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.NVhdivBEaEPipw4Mfy9sTg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.NVhdivBEaEPipw4Mfy9sTg","creator":{"__ref":"User:25229672"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1520959969418,"createdAt":1520959563910,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1520959969418,"text":"This fourth in the Aloha Shifters-Jewels of the Heart Series has lots of adventure, mystery and more new villains. There is also an amazing demonstration of the awesome power of the next Spirit Stone. Loved how resentful, irascible Tiger Shifter Cruz is charmed by easy going Surfer Jody whose motto is: 'Life is Beautiful, Love is Beautiful, You Just Have to Believe.' She was a charming addition to the mix of characters, and once again Keiki the Kitten brought out Cruz's softer, gentler, caring side.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe got a very interesting insight into who Cruz really is, as we explored the amazing Tree House he built. It was heartwarming to see his artistic and sentimental side celebrated in the way he decorated his home with things he had created that had great personal meaning.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI absolutely adored Cruz's inner Tiger's voice who was so very different from his personality. My favourite quote from the Book: \"...which meant it was just Cruz and Silas left at home, and hell. Neither one of them was the soft and fuzzy type. I can be soft and fuzzy, his tiger insisted...\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHighly recommend readers sign up for Anna's Newsletter to access the Bonus Scene epilogues that have heartfelt 'what happened after'. Still loving the tropical beauty of Hawaii as a backdrop for the story. Looking forward to next story to see how Silas (who has been stoic and suffering during the series), heals his heart and meets his mate. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"I am voluntarily reviewing a book gifted to me by the author with no obligation.\"","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AQBRF997Y1O04\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:33002272":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":33002272,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1405171665i/33002272.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1,"textReviewsCount":62,"name":"Lynda Sliger","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/33002272-lynda-sliger","contributor":null,"id":33002272},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ANJ38MS7X0EJ5":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ANJ38MS7X0EJ5"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ANJ38MS7X0EJ5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ANJ38MS7X0EJ5","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ANJ38MS7X0EJ5"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/33002272?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2116814450"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.02P25qt6pafH_Z4G1pUIyQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.02P25qt6pafH_Z4G1pUIyQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:33002272"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1504795515786,"createdAt":1504795500925,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1504795515294,"text":"I must say Anna lowe has hit it well with this book. It fits in nicely with the rest of the series though it doesn't require reading the rest to get the drift of the book itself.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eYou start the book with Crux, a former tiger-shifting marine who retired. He and all his buddies are trying the best to live a civilian life, yet they still hire out as different things such as PIs and bodyguards. Crux doesn't trust humans at all since his family was killed, starting out the novel with a lead to a target which he believes was their killer. His tiger argues with him when the target is made insisting that she must be innocent. However there is a second shooter there who is after that same target, so his tiger pushes him into protecting her.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJody is the woman in question, she is on a short term contract in the midst of her Pro-Surfing league in order to earn some much needed money for her family. She has always seemed to live life to the fullest and may be just what Crux needs to learn how to loosen up. Mix all of this up with a gem which could be one of the legendary Spirit Stones, you wind up with a tale that will enchant the reader and encourage them to go to the next page.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI personally don't think that any paranormal romance reader would be discouraged by the book, so in my opinion should give not only it, but the rest of the series a fair shot. I was given a copy of this book without any obligation, but figured a fair review would be worth the time!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ANJ38MS7X0EJ5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:37938776":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":37938776,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":18,"textReviewsCount":3147,"name":"Kathi","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/37938776-kathi","contributor":null,"id":37938776},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1KNOFGIPBQHX7":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1KNOFGIPBQHX7"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1KNOFGIPBQHX7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1KNOFGIPBQHX7","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1KNOFGIPBQHX7"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/37938776?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2115032839"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.xuC8C6LPKuc3c_kSQ7BkBA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.xuC8C6LPKuc3c_kSQ7BkBA","creator":{"__ref":"User:37938776"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1504647038766,"createdAt":1504647019810,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1504647038571,"text":"Ms. Lowe is a stellar writer – this series, this story in particular, is a prime example!!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhat a terrific set of characters!! Our main character is tiger-shifter Cruz; tough guy, assassin, savior, keeper of kitten Keiki, and resident of a self-built treehouse. Bring on heroine Jody; pro-surfer and temporary model to earn money for her struggling family. These two characters are the main ingredients to a story which will keep you on your toes and thoroughly entertained.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCruz lost his family and hates humans as they were the culprit. Jody is of course human, and does not know shifters exist. Though her life has not always been easy, she believes that life is beautiful; you just have to believe. The clash of these two world outlooks is absolutely entertaining.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eA strong dose of danger, intrigue and magic combined with a growing connection between our two main characters gives us a scintillating relationship with a side serving of humor:\u003cbr /\u003e\t“Why is surfing like sex? He looked at her expectantly. That, he had to hear. “When it’s good, it’s really , really good. And when it’s bad, it’s still pretty good.”\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eGenuinely written at a level where you feel with the characters and become part of the action.\u003cbr /\u003eA must read!!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e*** I am voluntarily leaving my honest review of this book ***\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1KNOFGIPBQHX7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:42796611":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":42796611,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1432367484i/42796611.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":37,"textReviewsCount":1296,"name":"Sherill","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/42796611-sherill","contributor":null,"id":42796611},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQQUPBFRJ2K7":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQQUPBFRJ2K7"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQQUPBFRJ2K7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQQUPBFRJ2K7","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQQUPBFRJ2K7"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/42796611?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2115563216"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.rEglRP_NNw0tw1tTf3UR9w":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.rEglRP_NNw0tw1tTf3UR9w","creator":{"__ref":"User:42796611"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1504694568470,"createdAt":1504693223645,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1504694568470,"text":"HEART-WARMING - DANGEROUS \u0026amp; HOT ROMANCE\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eEnchanting Koa Point is the home of Special Forces Brothers; a mixed secret group of shifters. This thrilling story lures the reader into the lives of Cruz and Jody with picturesque and dynamic scene descriptions, gripping suspense/spine-chilling action, lurking danger, there are some life-threating moments, sensuous passionate romance, and a heart-warming happy ever after leaves you smiling and wanting more.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCruz is a hunk and his bewitching eyes hold you hostage. The shadows of his past still haunt him, humans turn him off and he is closed off to love. Jody a beauty and full of life and is the complete opposite of Cruz. When a gunman tries to kill her Cruz rescues her; Jody is catapulted into a world she thought was only fantasy.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFantastic story that has you turning pages turning pages to see what happens next. The intriguing back stories give insight into the characters personas. The tantalizing banter between Cruz and Jody is fabulous. Their romance started with shocking circumstances but it is filled with much devotion and happiness; absolutely loved them together. Both are quite the heroes. If you love shifter romance stories this a wonderful book for your library. I loved this story so much {I voluntarily reviewed an advanced copy.} Without reservations, I recommend this book.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQQUPBFRJ2K7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:5196121":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":5196121,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1485755158i/5196121._UY200_CR50,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2,"textReviewsCount":1424,"name":"Karen","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/5196121-karen","contributor":null,"id":5196121},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A31WY1EPGZPMII":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A31WY1EPGZPMII"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A31WY1EPGZPMII\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A31WY1EPGZPMII","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A31WY1EPGZPMII"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/5196121?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2116397784"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.oHIP42-XRvV0ivomYjhpqA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.oHIP42-XRvV0ivomYjhpqA","creator":{"__ref":"User:5196121"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1504752534943,"createdAt":1504752096216,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1504752534943,"text":"\u003cstrong\u003eLure of the Tiger\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis KU library selection is an addition to an amazing series that just keeps getting better, and outside of Wolves of Willow Bend, this is my favorite. Cruz Khala is a former special forces soldier living at Koa Point on Maui with his brothers in arms, an assortment of shifters. His family was murdered while visiting India and the local villagers blamed the attack on humans. Cruz has been hunting those responsible and has been provided information about the person behind the assault. He makes a plan, but when the time comes to kill the assassin, he can't pull the trigger. Something isn't right and he senses his human target is innocent. But he also senses a second sniper with the unknown woman in his sights. And Cruz quickly shifts from termination to protection mode. \u003cbr /\u003eJody Monroe is a professional surfer on the island for a photo shoot for a fragrance line. She hates feeling that she's sold out, but needs the money for her family. Part of her contract is 'meet and greet's' at scheduled social events. Which is where she is when a large, intense man hustles her away as bullets start flying. Now he's asking her to trust him, a stranger. But she is in need of a bodyguard now, and that is just what he says he is. Oh, and that he was also trying to kill her.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A31WY1EPGZPMII\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:30896044":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":30896044,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1642831401i/30896044._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":47,"textReviewsCount":5475,"name":"Jamoz23","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/30896044-jamoz23","contributor":null,"id":30896044},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/30896044?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2113205694"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.pLGT7sHaA9_i92NnSqfe_Q":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.pLGT7sHaA9_i92NnSqfe_Q","creator":{"__ref":"User:30896044"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1504685699441,"createdAt":1504508567605,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1504685698897,"text":"You are missing out if you have not read this authors books.\u003cbr /\u003eOnce again Ms Lowe gives us another can’t put down book. From the first line till the end we get a fantastic read that has one thinking, what next?\u003cbr /\u003eHuman hating Tiger shifter Cruz is flummoxed when his tiger won’t let him kill a human woman believed to be responsible for his families murder.\u003cbr /\u003eI loved how Cruz was honest right from the start about what he was doing at the party. Him slowly finding his way to a HEA with his tiger giving him advice all the way along was so good.\u003cbr /\u003eJody is doing a modelling assignment, which she hates but she needs to money to help her dad and sister out.\u003cbr /\u003eWhen Cruz saves her from another attempt on her life things really start to speed up. We get Lion shifters and Vampires as the baddies to liven things up.\u003cbr /\u003eWe really don’t have too many of the group in this one as they are all off doing other things. Silas even gets called away, so when everything comes to a head, it is left up to Cruz and Jody, with the help of the Waterstone to save the day.\u003cbr /\u003eLoved having the gang all together at the end and cannot wait for Silas’ story to be told.\u003cbr /\u003eOne of my favourite things about this series is that these wonderful shifters have conversations with their animal halves too. It makes them seem more real and part of the whole story.\u003cbr /\u003eThis is my honest review of this book.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3V3UQQVF8OBTQ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:29345830":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":29345830,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2,"textReviewsCount":524,"name":"Terry","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/29345830-terry","contributor":null,"id":29345830},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AUU3NZYVCN7O4":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AUU3NZYVCN7O4"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AUU3N