per. Cruz has received intel pointing toward Jody as the one who murdered his family, but upon seeing her realizes that his information is flawed and is about to leave when another sniper catches his eye. Rather than killing her, he and his tiger do all in their power to save her and keep her from harm - and what better way than take her to his home? His instinct is pulling him ever closer to Jody, screaming at him that she is his destined mate. Will he be able to shake off the past to secure his future?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eA journey to find out what happened to get the wrong information begins as well as figuring if there is more in play here than first meets the eye...such as the next spirit stone? And what about the reappearance of Moira and the rumors swirling about Koa Point? (Don't know what I'm talking about? Read the book and you will.)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAs always, Anna's stories are well developed, character driven, steamy, and standalone (although they are much enhanced if read in order).\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is a voluntary review of an advanced copy.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A11HLZP9F0706R\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.maw-alnR7rBOCGiSrrAeDA\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:41987669":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":41987669,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1441572735i/41987669._UX200_CR0,16,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":2504,"name":"Toula","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/41987669-toula","contributor":null,"id":41987669},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2XROI2C3VWHGJ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2XROI2C3VWHGJ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2XROI2C3VWHGJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/am